      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 4.7,
          "en": "So for this NewMeetup component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.7,
          "end": 8.66,
          "en": "we again create a function here a component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.66,
          "end": 11.27,
          "en": "like the NewMeetupPage function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.27,
          "end": 14.57,
          "en": "And of course, as before we need to export this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.57,
          "end": 17.58,
          "en": "so that NextJS is able to find this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.58,
          "end": 20.89,
          "en": "and then we can render our content here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.89,
          "end": 23.05,
          "en": "Now our content in this case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.05,
          "end": 25.85,
          "en": "should be the NewMeetupForum component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.85,
          "end": 29.86,
          "en": "which I prepared in advance, which renders a form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.86,
          "end": 33.56,
          "en": "with some controls, with some styles attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.56,
          "end": 36.84,
          "en": "using CSS modules here for styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.84,
          "end": 39.69,
          "en": "I'll come back to that in a second, that is supported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.69,
          "end": 43.51,
          "en": "by NextJS out of the box, which is really convenient.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.51,
          "end": 46.29,
          "en": "And then here we get that data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.29,
          "end": 49.9,
          "en": "We extract that data, the user entered, with help offer Refs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.9,
          "end": 51.94,
          "en": "which has a built in React feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.94,
          "end": 54.37,
          "en": "has nothing to do with NextJS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.37,
          "end": 58.63,
          "en": "And then we basically call a function which we expect to get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.63,
          "end": 61.57,
          "en": "on the onAddMeetup prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.57,
          "end": 63.05,
          "en": "And to that function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.05,
          "end": 65.36,
          "en": "we then pass the collected meetup data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.36,
          "end": 68.173,
          "en": "So this object with all the collected data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.31,
          "end": 74.13,
          "en": "And hence now in this newMeetup index JS file here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.13,
          "end": 78.64699999999999,
          "en": "we can use that component and we can import newMeetupForm",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.26,
          "end": 84.96000000000001,
          "en": "from going up two levels to leave the pages folder diving",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.96000000000001,
          "end": 88.453,
          "en": "into the components folder, Meetups, and then newMeetupForm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 90.15,
          "end": 92.11,
          "en": "And then we can return newMeetupForm",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 93.88,
          "end": 96.563,
          "en": "this component like this if we want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 97.78999999999999,
          "end": 100.52000000000001,
          "en": "Now as I just mentioned, in this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 100.52000000000001,
          "end": 104.58,
          "en": "we do expect that there will be a onAddMeetup prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 104.58,
          "end": 106.86,
          "en": "which holds a function that we can call.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 106.86,
          "end": 108.32,
          "en": "And hence we might want to prepare",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.32,
          "end": 110.55,
          "en": "this function here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.55,
          "end": 113.95,
          "en": "We can add our addMeetupHandler function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.95,
          "end": 117.5,
          "en": "or however you want to name it and then pass a pointer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.5,
          "end": 122.5,
          "en": "after this function to the onAddMeetup prop a pointer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.63,
          "end": 125.58,
          "en": "and not the result of executing it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 125.58,
          "end": 128.43,
          "en": "So no parentheses here, because this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 128.43,
          "end": 132.65,
          "en": "should be executed eventually from inside that component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 132.65,
          "end": 135.723,
          "en": "when the form is submitted as it turns out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 136.57,
          "end": 139.733,
          "en": "Here, we then get our enteredMeetupData.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 141.148,
          "end": 143.57,
          "en": "And we can, for example, for the moment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 143.57,
          "end": 145.923,
          "en": "simply log this to the console.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 147.18,
          "end": 150.09,
          "en": "And with that out of the way, if we go back again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 150.09,
          "end": 154.1,
          "en": "we can visit localhost3000/newMeetup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 154.1,
          "end": 156.79,
          "en": "and we see this form again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 156.79,
          "end": 160.01,
          "en": "not to final styling a bit too wide,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 160.01,
          "end": 161.97,
          "en": "but we see the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 161.97,
          "end": 164.44,
          "en": "And if I opened the developer tools here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 164.44,
          "end": 169.44,
          "en": "and I enter test and test, or here, we actually need a URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 171.2,
          "end": 174.14,
          "en": "So I will just quickly grab that URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 174.14,
          "end": 177.7,
          "en": "which I set up for my dummy data, this URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 177.7,
          "end": 181.71,
          "en": "I'll grab that and use this here Test Address.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 181.71,
          "end": 183.26,
          "en": "And This is a test.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 183.26,
          "end": 186.65,
          "en": "If we enter this data and we click Add Meetup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 186.65,
          "end": 189.37,
          "en": "we see this object logged to the console.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 189.37,
          "end": 191.63,
          "en": "So handling form submission works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 191.63,
          "end": 194.02,
          "en": "Obviously we're not doing anything with that data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 194.02,
          "end": 196.47,
          "en": "At this point, we're not navigating away",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 196.47,
          "end": 199.59,
          "en": "and we are going to do all these things later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 199.59,
          "end": 202.43,
          "en": "but this again just shows us how we can use pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 202.43,
          "end": 207.29,
          "en": "and also mix regular React components into those pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 207.29,
          "end": 210.11,
          "en": "And then, with that, that's a great start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 210.11,
          "end": 213.13,
          "en": "but now we're already facing a couple of issues here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 213.13,
          "end": 215.9,
          "en": "We've got a lot of missing functionality, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 215.9,
          "end": 218.97,
          "en": "And for example, we also have no way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 218.97,
          "end": 221.71,
          "en": "for navigating between pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 221.71,
          "end": 225.88,
          "en": "and we have no general layout around our pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 225.88,
          "end": 228.19,
          "en": "Every page takes up the entire width.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 228.19,
          "end": 230.12,
          "en": "We get no header above them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 230.12,
          "end": 233.053,
          "en": "And that is probably something we want to change.",
          "zh": ""
        }
